---
import BaseLayout from "@components/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <main class="flex flex-col px-4 gap-y-5 mt-10 mx-auto max-w-2xl text-[1.1rem]/7 sm:px-0">
    <h1 class="mb-3 font-semibold text-black dark:text-white text-4xl ">Léo Mercier</h1>
    <p>
      Hey, I'm Léo Mercier, a
      <span class="bg-linear-to-r from-purple-400 to-red-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">creative</span>
      engineer, open-source fanatic and privacy advocate.
    </p>

    <p>
      Working at&nbsp;
      <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-1.5 rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 font-medium text-sm/5 forced-colors:outline bg-purple-400/20 text-purple-700 group-data-hovered:bg-purple-400/30 dark:bg-purple-400/20 dark:text-purple-300 dark:group-data-hovered:bg-purple-400/15" href="https://groupebpce.com/" target="_blank">BPCE</a>
      <br />
      Creator of&nbsp;
      <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-1.5 rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 font-medium text-sm/5 forced-colors:outline bg-zinc-400/20 text-zinc-700 group-data-hovered:bg-zinc-400/30 dark:bg-zinc-400/15 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:group-data-hovered:bg-zinc-400/15" href="https://github.com/Sawangg/HeraUI/" target="_blank">HeraUI</a>
    </p>

    <p>I’m passionate about turning my crazy ideas into reality. You can find my full <a class="text-black underline underline-offset-3 decoration-black/30 hover:decoration-black dark:text-white dark:decoration-white/40 dark:hover:decoration-white" href="/projects">projects list here</a>.</p>
    <p>I write <a class="text-black underline underline-offset-3 decoration-black/30 hover:decoration-black dark:text-white dark:decoration-white/40 dark:hover:decoration-white" href="https://leomercier.blog/" target="_blank">blog</a>
      posts about open-source, finance, tutorials, etc. Occasionally, I also do some coding live streams on Twitch.</p>
    <p>Outside of programming, I enjoy fitness and reading a good book. Right now I live in the City of Lights, Paris 🇫🇷. If you are around, feel free to reach out, we could have a chat or work together.</p>
    <hr class="my-2 w-1/3 self-center text-black/20 dark:text-white/30" />
    <p>Find me on <span>Github</span> or email me <span class="font-mono text-base">hi@leomercier.dev</span></p>
    <hr class="my-2 w-1/3 self-center text-black/20 dark:text-white/30" />
    <p>If you ever found my content useful, feel free to donate to help me deliver more content. Thank you!</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
